Z||000000||WisconsinGT||06-09-2000||09:30 PM||||I was told that one of my tie rods on the front passenger side is a bit loose. Is it possible to get a new one somewhere? Are they difficult to remove/install? Thanks!||||reg||1
Z||000001||sdm1964||06-09-2000||09:47 PM||||Is it the inner or outer? The outer is the easyer of the 2. I think rodney has a bushing for the inner on on the passenger side. Good luck,<BR>Stephen||||reg||1
Z||000002||batboy||06-09-2000||11:13 PM||||Rodney's bushing is for the passenger side of the rack. If the inner or outer tie rods are worn, it must be replaced. The outer is easiest to do.||||reg||1
